WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
The panel opens on Quick Transfer, which has a drop area and options for a PIN and an expiry time.

00:05.000 --> 00:12.000
A file is chosen. A QR code, a local link and a ten minute countdown appear, and the file waits for the phone.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000
Stop sharing ends the share.
